# ---- source images (never published, never committed) ----
# Drop originals into _images/ ; the build reads them and emits derivatives to images/.
# Copy the masters to the cloud first — this folder is easy to lose.
_images/*
!_images/metadata.json
!_images/rows.json
!_images/.gitkeep

